How this driver was made
------------------------

This is not a clean-room implementation. The behaviour of Canon's cnijfilter
3.40 driver (its published GPLv2 source and its binary modules) was analysed with
reverse-engineering tools by an AI coding assistant (Anthropic Claude Code),
and that analysis was then ported to Go. The port was validated by comparing
its output byte for byte with the output of Canon's driver. The code therefore
derives from Canon's driver and reproduces its behaviour, including its
quirks (docs/KNOWN-QUIRKS.md). Canon's licence restricts reverse engineering of
its binary modules; anyone using or redistributing this project should form
their own view of that point.
